  push yourself at every workout and  remember to always give your best so  these are some of the common questions I  get asked every so often I hope this  video has helped debunk some of the  Finnick myths you might have heard what  other myths have you come across let me  know in the comments below so if you  find this video to be helpful to give  this video a thumb up share it and  subscribe to my youtube channel for new  videos every Monday Wednesday and Friday  do also turn on your notification button  so that  we'll get notified every time I upload a  new video all the best
 

